WEBVTT

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:17.090
Major Counselor.

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:18.990
Enter.

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:20.830
Excuse me.

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:26.870
The rumored tragic princess, Suetsumuhana.

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:30.940
I wish to see her face as soon as possible.

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:32.840
So, where is her answer?

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.210
I have asked on various occasions, but she refuses.

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:38.110
The capital is currently in a crisis.

00:00:38.110 --> 00:00:42.080
She says that now is not the time for romance.

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:44.020
I do not understand.

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:45.120
Yes?

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:48.390
A letter carrier carries letters.

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:54.300
But this woman brings no letter and speaks of things I did not even ask.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:57.370
Do you not find that strange?

00:00:57.370 --> 00:01:00.540
Yes, very strange.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:02.630
I-I am very sorry!

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:25.260
You have grown quite pale.
That is not beautiful.

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:30.590
Yes, well, that is fine.

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:42.170
What a terrible flavor.

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:51.950
<i>The white lotus flower blooms</i>

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:58.660
<i>The key to the bright night sky appears</i>

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:04.300
<i>And now the hazy barrier fades away</i>

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:09.440
<i>The unstoppable fate of time</i>

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:14.000
<i>The ever repeating link</i>

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:21.650
<i>Madder red clouds are swallowed up by darkness</i>

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:26.890
<i>Swirling desire gives it strength</i>

00:02:26.890 --> 00:02:32.890
<i>A darkness that even provokes this love</i>

00:02:32.890 --> 00:02:34.900
<i>Quick as lightning</i>

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:38.000
<i>Illusions, show your true form</i>

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:43.200
<i>Sky, storm violently</i>

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:48.840
<i>As the fang of steel shines with a golden gleam</i>

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:58.840
<i>Why do people yearn for love so much</i> <i>their souls become dyed with crimson?</i>

00:02:59.350 --> 00:03:04.890
<i>Protect it to the end!</i>

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:07.600
<i>Toward the light of the pure white lotus.</i>

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:11.870
<i>AH... GARO</i>

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:12.960
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:17.960
"SOUL MOON"

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:23.280
Who cares about what happened in the past.

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:25.580
Think about the future.

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:26.810
Goodbye.

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:31.620
Seimei. What are you thinking?

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:34.860
Raiko-<i>sama</i>, please eat something.

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:37.190
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:41.460
What am I going to do now?

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:43.230
Please get ahold of yourself!

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:46.800
To be distressed is human and cannot be helped!

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:49.600
However, this is hardly the time!

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:50.970
The Light Palace was attacked

00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:54.110
and the capital may continue to fall into chaos!

00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:57.980
This is the time when your power is needed most, Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:00.780
You're right. I'm sorry, Kintoki.

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:05.110
A fox spirit?

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:10.460
You've come.

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:12.590
Yes.

00:04:12.590 --> 00:04:14.230
The little one is here, too.

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:21.240
I-I am h-honored to be called to the Watchdog Center today!

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:22.900
Calm down, Kintoki!

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:28.340
Hm? Why is that little bean so excited?

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:32.580
He is nervous about officially being called here for the first time.

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:35.450
I am not a bean! I am Kintoki!

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:37.150
A Kintoki bean.

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:39.650
If possible, I'd like the "bean" part omitted.

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:42.420
Please don't tease Kintoki too much.

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:47.360
Raiko, it seems you can finally don your armor on your own.

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:48.930
Y-Yes.

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:53.840
However, I still do not trust you completely.

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:56.440
I will keep that in mind.

00:04:56.440 --> 00:05:01.510
Goodness. You and Hakamadare.
What troublesome knights.

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:03.340
Yasusuke, as well?

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:07.980
That man, while I was speaking to him...

00:05:07.980 --> 00:05:09.520
Are you listening?

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:13.350
You seem pretty full of yourself.
Just how old are you?

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:14.490
What did you say?

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:16.490
I won't take orders from you.

00:05:16.490 --> 00:05:19.060
I'll do things how I want.

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:20.730
Such an insolent guy.

00:05:20.730 --> 00:05:22.900
I dislike Hakamadare.

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:25.970
Gold is faithful and Silver is feral.

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:27.970
I-I see.

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:31.410
Well, let's discuss the reason you were summoned.

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:40.010
Don't push!

00:05:40.010 --> 00:05:42.750
There is plenty of rice porridge!

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:43.910
Hot!

00:05:44.390 --> 00:05:46.650
Yorinobu-<i>sama</i> did it again!

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:50.820
Goodness. This is why I cannot leave things to you, Yorinobu-<i>sama.</i>

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:55.700
Suetsumuhana-<i>dono.</i>

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:57.270
Is that the rumored...?

00:05:57.270 --> 00:05:59.870
Can't you tell by the way she's dressed?

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:02.670
I've heard the rumors, but to think they were true...

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:04.440
Did you burn yourself?

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:06.370
No, I'm fine.

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:11.720
Here you go.

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:14.020
Thank you very much.

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:17.190
Such a waste. It's so wasted on me!

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:21.790
Please don't think that way.
Now, please eat before it gets cold.

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:25.090
Everyone is lining up for Yorinobu-<i>sama...</i>

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:31.470
Why are you scared?
Do I look like an evil spirit?

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:32.930
No...

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:37.110
Then, come closer.
Be careful that you don't spill.

00:06:37.110 --> 00:06:38.810
Like Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>!

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:40.070
Yeah.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:45.270
Come on, line up properly!

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:48.750
Here, that's a good boy.

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:50.740
Thank you, Sis!

00:06:58.260 --> 00:07:00.930
In these past few days, after the Horrors were eliminated,

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:04.360
the Light Palace has almost completely recovered.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:09.000
However, the destruction of the gate made many lose their homes.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:11.770
And, as you can see, the capital is in a dire state.

00:07:13.110 --> 00:07:16.310
Is it okay for you to move separately from Kintou and the others?

00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:20.180
Brother, I cannot don armor and fight like you.

00:07:20.180 --> 00:07:23.790
But, I will fight in my own way.

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:27.920
Who cares about image right now?
I've told my retainers the same.

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:30.460
You've grown into such a fine man!

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:33.030
It looks like you were able to take a weight off your shoulders.

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:35.600
Th-That's not true!

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:40.360
I have come to think this way because of the two of you, Brother.

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:46.140
Um, what has happened to Seimei-<i>san</i> after that?

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:48.840
We have been searching for her, but...

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:52.350
Knowing her, I'm sure she's enjoying herself somewhere.

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:56.180
Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>, it looks like we've managed to feed most everyone.

00:07:56.180 --> 00:07:57.620
I really appreciate it.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:01.390
Oh, perfect timing.
This is my older brother, Raiko.

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:03.390
It is nice to meet you.

00:08:03.390 --> 00:08:06.230
Brother, this is Suetsumuhana-<i>dono.</i>

00:08:06.230 --> 00:08:10.570
She responded to my call for aid and helps me here.

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:12.930
A woman aristocrat like you must have faced resistance,

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:16.240
showing your face in public.
It is very admirable.

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:20.040
I do not care about such things in the least.

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:25.480
Though my household raised quite a fuss since they dislike me going out.

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:27.220
That must have been very hard.

00:08:27.220 --> 00:08:31.490
You have it much tougher, Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>!

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:34.190
Oh! Yes! Sorry.

00:08:34.190 --> 00:08:38.590
Don't you think they look really good together, Raiko-<i>sama</i>?

00:08:40.430 --> 00:08:44.530
Kid, don't be rude to Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>!

00:08:44.530 --> 00:08:48.200
She is a very strong and heartening lady.

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:49.900
Yes, truly.

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:56.800
Who is that?

00:08:58.750 --> 00:08:59.910
Tooru-<i>dono.</i>

00:08:59.910 --> 00:09:00.920
That's him?

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:02.050
Do you know him?

00:09:02.050 --> 00:09:03.080
Yes.

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:07.290
When I was young,
I visited his mansion on Rokujo street.

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:09.960
He is the number one ladies' man among the Genji.

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:13.260
He is also called the Shining One.

00:09:13.260 --> 00:09:18.370
The name, Shining One of Genji, appears in a lot of love affair rumors.

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:21.870
He overstepped his boundaries and the aristocrats turned against him,

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:24.610
forcing him to retire in the country of Akashi.

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:26.640
Then, why...

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:29.540
The attack on the Light Palace created a need for court officials

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:31.310
and he was called back a few days ago.

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:32.210
Go.

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:35.620
Even to this day, he still looks so young.

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:38.150
He keeps sending me letters, too.

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:39.890
What did you say?!

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:42.920
He said he will visit my house tomorrow evening.

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:45.050
T-Tooru-<i>dono</i> will?!

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:53.940
I was wondering why they summoned us,

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:56.770
but I didn't expect gifts for becoming a full-fledged knight!

00:09:56.770 --> 00:10:00.010
The Watchdog Center is so generous!

00:10:00.010 --> 00:10:04.310
I don't think the Watchdog Center would give us something for nothing in return.

00:10:04.310 --> 00:10:05.980
What do you mean?

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:09.150
Something troublesome may happen soon.

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:10.950
Be careful.

00:10:10.950 --> 00:10:14.460
They said they'd even give you a mansion with servants!

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.620
You should have accepted their offer.

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:19.690
It's easier for me with just the two of us.

00:10:19.690 --> 00:10:21.190
I don't have to deal with any noisiness.

00:10:30.610 --> 00:10:32.640
There is no need for words.

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:37.180
Your beauty says it all.

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:41.280
I am also happy just gazing upon your face, Tooru-<i>sama.</i>

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:45.220
I see, then will you become its sustenance?

00:10:45.220 --> 00:10:46.210
Sustenance?

00:10:58.070 --> 00:11:02.200
This is no longer enough.

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:15.980
Disappearing girls?

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:18.950
Aristocrats have been coming to complain the last couple of days,

00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:21.180
it is really quite troublesome.

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:22.950
When did this start?

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:25.650
Just a few days ago.

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:29.160
A few days ago... Girls...

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:32.190
I will leave this case to you.

00:11:32.190 --> 00:11:33.560
Understood.

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:38.000
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:41.340
Another message from the Watchdog Center!

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:42.900
What is it?

00:11:42.900 --> 00:11:44.140
A Horror.

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:45.840
I'll prepare dinner immediately!

00:11:45.840 --> 00:11:48.140
You cannot fight on an empty stomach!

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:50.750
This is far from troublesome.

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:52.180
Have your senses dulled?

00:11:54.550 --> 00:11:55.820
What?!

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:58.250
Tooru-<i>sama</i> may be an evil spirit?!

00:11:58.250 --> 00:11:59.890
We aren't absolutely sure.

00:11:59.890 --> 00:12:04.760
But after lining everything up, we cannot ignore the possibility.

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:10.670
And if that is true, you will be targeted, Suetsumuhana-<i>dono.</i>

00:12:10.670 --> 00:12:16.540
Impossible! You know what they call me behind my back.

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:18.570
I am the tragic princess!

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:19.770
Tragic?

00:12:19.770 --> 00:12:23.380
With my lack of talent for music, body size, and actions,

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:25.950
I can no longer be considered a girl.

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:27.680
Once Tooru-<i>sama</i> sees me--

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:29.520
That is not true!

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:30.950
Huh?

00:12:30.950 --> 00:12:34.460
There are not many with such a beautiful heart as yours!

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:35.850
Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>?

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:43.060
You really, truly have grown into a fine--

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:48.240
Kid, Yorinobu-<i>sama</i> is just being polite!

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:52.540
Suetsumuhana-<i>dono</i>, please move everyone to a different area.

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:12.260
Tooru-<i>dono</i>!

00:13:14.930 --> 00:13:16.960
A Makai Knight.

00:13:24.770 --> 00:13:26.440
Huh?!

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:29.500
Evil spirit! Prepare yourself!

00:13:33.650 --> 00:13:34.650
I've lost.

00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:37.020
What did you come here for?!

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:38.950
Let him go.

00:13:38.950 --> 00:13:40.650
Who are you?

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:42.690
You were the one who sent me letters.

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:44.160
What?

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:46.160
I am Suetsumuhana.

00:13:46.160 --> 00:13:48.700
Now, take me away!

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:51.100
You?

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:56.170
That ugliness. I see, so you are the tragic princess.

00:13:56.170 --> 00:13:57.300
What?!

00:13:57.300 --> 00:13:59.010
Looking at you disgusts me.

00:13:59.010 --> 00:14:01.310
Disappear from my sight!

00:14:01.310 --> 00:14:04.310
Weren't you targeting this person?!

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:09.220
Yorinobu-<i>dono</i>, you have become so beautiful.

00:14:09.220 --> 00:14:11.620
Now, let us go together.

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:16.660
I-I don't understand!

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:18.860
What does he plan to do with Yorinobu?!

00:14:18.860 --> 00:14:21.230
W-Well, probably...

00:14:21.230 --> 00:14:25.630
It may take you a little time to understand, Raiko-<i>sama.</i>

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:27.230
I will explain later.

00:14:27.230 --> 00:14:29.800
Right now, we have to chase after him!

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:31.530
Yeah, you're right.

00:14:37.550 --> 00:14:39.750
Tooru-<i>dono</i>, what is the meaning of this?!

00:14:39.750 --> 00:14:42.580
It is because you are beautiful.

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:45.890
I love beautiful things.

00:14:45.890 --> 00:14:47.860
I am a man!

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:50.320
It does not matter if you are a man or woman.

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:52.360
Beautiful things are truly delicious.

00:14:52.360 --> 00:14:55.600
How did someone as fortunate as you become a Horror?!

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:59.270
It could not be helped.

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:01.940
For someone of such a low status as myself.

00:15:01.940 --> 00:15:03.870
This is like a dream come true.

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:07.210
Beauty does not know status.

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:08.540
Oh.

00:15:09.780 --> 00:15:12.350
A gray hair.

00:15:12.350 --> 00:15:16.370
It is proof that you work hard for the people.

00:15:24.930 --> 00:15:29.900
No way, m-me? I am getting old?!

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:35.100
No. No! No! No! No! No!

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:37.970
Are you afraid of getting old?

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:39.440
Tooru-<i>sama</i>?

00:15:39.440 --> 00:15:42.210
Do you want a body that doesn't age?

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:44.310
Wh-What did you say?!

00:15:44.310 --> 00:15:48.950
If you accept me, your wish will come true.

00:15:48.950 --> 00:15:49.950
I want it!

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:52.980
I should be beautiful for all eternity!

00:15:53.990 --> 00:15:55.620
I understand.

00:16:17.340 --> 00:16:20.150
That was the situation that couldn't be helped?!

00:16:20.150 --> 00:16:21.450
You are crazy!

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:25.950
True, my beauty is worth insanity.

00:16:25.950 --> 00:16:28.250
What do you think people are?!

00:16:29.160 --> 00:16:30.360
Food.

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:33.420
You bastard!

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:45.940
Just how does such a beautiful man taste?

00:16:53.650 --> 00:16:55.850
Kintoki, take care of Yorinobu.

00:16:55.850 --> 00:16:56.980
Leave it to me!

00:16:57.820 --> 00:17:01.690
This is why I hate Makai Knights.

00:17:01.690 --> 00:17:03.660
Right, Yorinobu-<i>dono</i>?

00:17:06.130 --> 00:17:07.290
Yorinobu!

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:10.900
Open your eyes!

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:12.170
Shit!

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:15.040
Damn you, evil spirit! Prepare yourself!

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:17.000
You, again?

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:18.370
Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>?

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:21.010
Yorinobu is not himself! Run away!

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:24.550
Why is such ugliness in my sight?

00:17:24.550 --> 00:17:27.350
Do you not find that strange?

00:17:27.350 --> 00:17:30.220
Yes, very strange.

00:17:31.890 --> 00:17:37.190
Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>, the one who called me beautiful was you!

00:17:37.190 --> 00:17:41.930
Stupid! Beautiful is something used to describe this face!

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:53.570
True beauty is the beauty of your heart!

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:55.470
Suetsu...

00:17:57.040 --> 00:18:00.210
Do not be tricked by such an ugly creature as that.

00:18:00.210 --> 00:18:03.580
Ugly? Me?

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:07.420
There is no way I am ugly!

00:18:19.230 --> 00:18:20.770
Seimei!

00:18:20.770 --> 00:18:22.470
Lingering feelings, Raiko?

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:23.800
Shut up!

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:18.420
The moon.

00:19:42.550 --> 00:19:44.280
I will protect her!

00:19:51.190 --> 00:19:56.030
I will not let him hurt you any further!

00:19:56.030 --> 00:19:57.870
Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>!

00:19:57.870 --> 00:19:59.420
Yorinobu!

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:01.160
I will definitely protect you all!

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:17.810
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:48.050
Brother. Kintoki.

00:20:48.050 --> 00:20:53.350
Suetsumuhana-<i>dono</i>. I am very sorry--

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:59.230
You are the first man who ever tried to protect me, Yorinobu-<i>sama.</i>

00:20:59.230 --> 00:21:02.400
For that, I am ever so happy.

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:08.400
Oh, as I thought, you are truly beaut--

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:10.040
Y-Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>!

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:13.800
It's all right. He has just lost consciousness.

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:19.880
Seimei, it's true that humans are weak.

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:24.320
That is why they continue to create darkness and turn into Horrors.

00:21:24.320 --> 00:21:28.160
You may not be able to forgive such weakness, but...

00:21:28.160 --> 00:21:33.290
Even so, I will protect the people.

00:21:33.290 --> 00:21:37.990
If I meet you again, this time...

00:21:44.270 --> 00:21:46.110
So it's begun.

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:47.510
It's begun.

00:21:48.610 --> 00:21:52.680
It is as if the moon was stained with blood.

00:21:52.680 --> 00:21:56.320
This is the Crimson Moon.

00:21:56.320 --> 00:22:00.520
Zaruba, it looks like you might be right.

00:22:00.520 --> 00:22:03.190
That doesn't make me happy.

00:22:03.190 --> 00:22:07.680
But, no matter what happens,
I will no longer waver.

00:22:53.210 --> 00:23:01.150
<i>Whilst looking at the filling moon</i>

00:23:01.150 --> 00:23:11.240
<i>Today, as well, I bury these growing feelings</i>

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:18.270
<i>The skies of fate have split in two</i>

00:23:18.270 --> 00:23:24.260
<i>(Shine upon the darkness) Lead me</i>

00:23:25.740 --> 00:23:30.610
<i>Yearning for the light, I throw out my heart</i>

00:23:30.610 --> 00:23:35.750
<i>I will always be beside you</i>

00:23:35.750 --> 00:23:42.390
<i>So until the last moment of this life</i>

00:23:42.390 --> 00:23:47.590
<i>Let me see this fleeting dream</i>

00:23:50.950 --> 00:24:00.960
"Next Episode: WORST"

00:23:52.650 --> 00:23:57.060
No matter the era, certain things never change.

00:23:57.060 --> 00:23:59.030
Such is humanity.
